body = ("**EM-B1f LANDED at `6b57180ef51ed06ce8ed9048be7602351b497f1d` — THE ELEVENTH LANDING** (13 files, +206/−24: `src/domain/roads/state.js` +18; the four test homes; `statusUnionTotality.walker.test.js` +53; two edge bundles and five metas; trailer `Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5`; the hook rewrote nothing — the six hashes matched at three moments). THE SEAL: `4fe12b7597d79918f6187e5a38f67deb208c8fd170eb33ea19bbf12d8edc295c` at c127cdfb2, capsule `fb88e18d…76e6` (moved from the first seal's `baa70e3b…0c50` — the re-seal was needed, not ceremony). BOTH SEALED VERBS RAN ALL 17 STEPS (the runner does not stop at the first failure — the checks-8–12 contingency never applied): `check:packet` and `implementation:resume` each EXIT 1 for exactly one reason, `focused-7`; every other step 0 — focused-2 9/9 · focused-5 52/52 · focused-6 4/4 · focused-7 26/27 (⛔ the one named pre-existing red) · focused-8 159/159 · **focused-11 = THE THIRD AMENDMENT'S SEALED `tests/lint` STEP ON ITS FIRST EXECUTION: 173 files, 2757/2757** · typecheck:ratchet OK (167/167) · domain-strict ✓ (1113/1113) · observed-shape 1964 exactly matching · writer-reach judged 6537 · LIT 572 · LIT-NAME 4671 · DARK 1294 · validate `valid: 194 packets (1 READY)`. THE NAMED RED, quoted: `dossierProseManifest.test.js :: ⭐ THE PROVENANCE REFUSES A FIXTURE ITS RECORDER DID NOT WRITE` — proved not the packet's by a clean-tree run at c127cdfb2 (identical title, 1/20); nothing re-recorded; the cure is the owner's door (§934.71). Goldens byte-identical (`7177cd6e…8f1e`, `921c51cf…db41`); lighting +4 titles, nothing else; edge-shared exactly seven paths (`aiCharterBundle` `577116ea20da66f5 → bfd7319b0bf11c80`, `aiOutputSchemaBundle` `556608bff80c94a6 → 436c77005fab7f7a`, three siblings `generatedAt`-only). The lane's honesty note accepted: the dist-read byte arm was not run under the seal — the `< 679_000` engine literal is proved by the chair's landing build + `verify:dist`. "
 "**THE FLIP `7a6f85d20`** (`valid: 194 packets (0 READY)`): header, manifest, both index rows; §6's contract and its §11 echo re-cut to the haystack-cast form the build proved (with the TS2345 note); §13.0's `exiled`/`removed` claim MARKED REFUTED and annotated — a landed packet's record is not rewritten, it is annotated. THE PROCESS LAW: the chair's `npm run build` (exclusive mutex) + `verify:dist` bare in the consist detached at 6b57180ef — IN FLIGHT (log `<SP>/consist-dist-measure-6b57180ef.log`). THE SIXTH REFREEZE launched at 7a6f85d20 behind the build (the door then the plain run; `suiteTitles` MEASURED this time; the commit gated on `files = 2656`). "
 "**THE USAGE LIMIT (09:4x → 11:40):** three working lanes were cut mid-work — TOOL-15 (the walker's mutant battery; its branch already carries `1c33181d6`: EM-B1k2's landed requiredSymbols row re-spelled), TOOL-22 (at the fixture proof), TOOL-24 (writing commit 1's instrument) — RESUMED at 11:42 from their transcripts by SendMessage with 'verify state first' (the recovery class of addendum 5x; their worktrees hold 1 / 3 / 1 dirty files). The paused lanes (FIX-D9, FIX-T2, TOOL-19, FIX-B2) were untouched. THE GATE at 11:4x: the shared tier EMPTY (B1f landed; P1b done) → **FIX-B2 HANDED THE GATE** (its three exclusive builds serialize behind the chair's landing build through the mutex); then FIX-D9 → FIX-T2 → TOOL-19 → FIX-K1 → TOOL-7a → TOOL-9 → TOOL-8a → FIX-P2 → FIX-D7 → FIX-T1 → FIX-D8 → the dead agents. THE COMPOSITION SITTING (this sitting, after the refreeze commit): the six finished lanes' 20 commits — FIX-L1 (2) → FIX-P3 (5) → FIX-P4 (2) → FIX-P5 (5) → FIX-P1b (1) → FIX-C2b (4) → TOOL-13b (1) — re-probed at the flip tip in a throwaway worktree (the result quoted in the next addendum), then cherry-picked into the slot in that order, then ONE composition re-proof lane runs every lane's declared count lines at the composed tip (the FIX-C2 idiom, consolidated), then the chair's docs commit (the standard's two hot-file rows; the §934.71 shift-record draft committed under `docs/shift-records/` with `ownerWords` PENDING), then RUN 22 in the consist at the composed tip.")
